{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29160","headline":"东游留别李丛秀才 · 许浑","name":"东游留别李丛秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烦君沽酒强登楼，罢唱离歌说远游。\n文字岂劳诸子重，风尘多幸故人忧。\n数程山路长侵夜，千里家书动隔秋。\n起凭栏干各垂泪，又驱羸马向东州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}